baremetal has no OS/syscalls: pkg/std/os/sys's POSIX wrappers (Open/Read/Write/Close/Lseek/Pread/Pwrite/Mkdir/Fork/Waitpid/ChildExecOrExit/Accessible/Interrupted/FailErrno/...) are undefined at link time under arm32-baremetal QEMU semihosting (fork/waitpid/open cannot be stubbed there). Same fundamental limitation as pkg/std/os. See claude-todo.md.
